      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Workflow 1 — Dynamic Search Queue Generator\n\n**What it does:** This workflow creates Google search tasks using different cities, keywords, and search patterns. It only prepares the searches. It does not actually search on Google.\n\n**Input:** It takes data from three Google Sheets tabs: `Cities`, `Keywords`, and `Run_Config`.\n\n**Output:** It adds all the search tasks to the `Search_Queue` tab with the status `Pending`.\n\n**Example:** If we have 2 cities, 2 keywords, and 4 search patterns, the workflow will create **16 search tasks**.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d2a24770-5ac1-49d5-9dbb-1a958a913256",
      "name": "Sticky 9",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
